      answer: "Not always. Whether an agency asks for one depends on the data the system will handle, the agency's risk appetite and its procurement rules, and it is most likely where a cloud service holds sensitive or classified information. IRAP is an assessment, not a certification. Hosting on an IRAP assessed cloud doesn't assess your application, because the controls you build and configure sit outside the platform's assessment. AWLabs holds no IRAP assessment.",
    },
